  "insights": [
    "OAuth2 is the dominant auth method (56/100 apps = 56%), with API key a close second (21 apps). CRM and Finance categories lean OAuth2; Dev tools lean API key.",
    "71 apps (71%) are buildable today with no blockers. Another 23 are buildable with caveats (paid plan, rate limits, partial OAuth).",
    "Only 58 apps (58%) have an existing MCP server \u2014 massive gap Composio can fill.",
    "Self-serve access (free/trial) covers 72 apps (72%), while 28 apps require payment, approval, or partner status \u2014 these need outreach.",
    "The most common blocker is 'No public developer API available', affecting 4 apps.",
    "The 3 Finance apps most often require sales contact or partner gating \u2014 highest resistance to self-serve tooling.",
    "Dev & Infra tools (71 of that category buildable today) and Productivity tools offer the clearest quick wins for Composio's agent toolkit roadmap."
  ]
